==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1~4 seconds<sup>30f~120f</sup>.
*1 [[Zigge]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 95% HP:
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 93% HP:
**1 [[Zir Zeal]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This Outbreak can be beaten by simply bringing an Anti-zombie, as this is a very simple Outbreak. [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Vaulter]] is good, as is [[Gardener Cat (Rare Cat)|Gardener]] or [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Wushu]].

